-- Layer 1: is the loss covered? For each head of cover a case inside it, and for each
-- exclusion one case it catches and one near miss it does not. Expected answers worked by
-- hand from Articles 10, 11 and Part IV. Fixtures: bvvcx-tests-fixtures.l4.

§ `Tests — Article 10: the heads of cover`

#ASSERT `the cover decision for` `the standard claim` EQUALS `covered under` `10.1.1 collision, overturning, toppling, loss of balance, sinking, falling, or being struck from outside`
#ASSERT `the cover decision for` (`a standard claim for` (`a sudden` `an explosion` `on 15 June 2026, damaging` `the standard parts`)) EQUALS `covered under` `10.1.2 conflagration, fire or explosion`
#ASSERT `the cover decision for` (`a standard claim for` (`a sudden` `a fire` `on 15 June 2026, damaging` `the standard parts`)) EQUALS `covered under` `10.1.2 conflagration, fire or explosion`
#ASSERT `the cover decision for` (`a standard claim for` (`a sudden` `a physical explosion from excess pressure` `on 15 June 2026, damaging` `the standard parts`)) EQUALS `outside the cover of Article 10`
#ASSERT `the cover decision for` (`a standard claim for` (`a sudden` `a natural catastrophe beyond human control` `on 15 June 2026, damaging` `the standard parts`)) EQUALS `covered under` `10.1.3 a natural catastrophe beyond human control`
#ASSERT `the cover decision for` (`a standard claim for` (`a sudden` `theft of the whole vehicle` `on 15 June 2026, damaging` EMPTY)) EQUALS `covered under` `10.1.4 loss of the whole vehicle by theft or robbery`
#ASSERT `the cover decision for` (`a standard claim for` (`a sudden` `robbery of the whole vehicle` `on 15 June 2026, damaging` EMPTY)) EQUALS `covered under` `10.1.4 loss of the whole vehicle by theft or robbery`
#ASSERT `the cover decision for` (`a standard claim for` (`a sudden` `a cause Article 10.1 does not list` `on 15 June 2026, damaging` `the standard parts`)) EQUALS `outside the cover of Article 10`
#ASSERT `the cover decision for` (`a standard claim for` (`a sudden` `flooding in rain, storm or flood` `on 15 June 2026, damaging` `the standard parts`)) EQUALS `outside the cover of Article 10`
-- Fraud is not theft or robbery (fork F25).
#ASSERT `the cover decision for` (`a standard claim for` (`a sudden` `the whole vehicle taken by fraud or abuse of trust` `on 15 June 2026, damaging` EMPTY)) EQUALS `outside the cover of Article 10`

-- Not sudden and unforeseeable: outside the chapeau (fork F4).
`a collision that was not sudden` MEANS
    `an event on` (YMD 2026 6 15) `: peril` `a collision` `, sudden` FALSE `, at` `in Vietnam` `, war` FALSE `, deliberate` EMPTY
        `, hired out` FALSE `, inspection` `a valid inspection certificate` `, load` `a normal load` `, parts` `the standard parts`
        `, paint` NOTHING `, police suspension` FALSE `, earlier part thefts` 0
#ASSERT `the cover decision for` (`a standard claim for` `a collision that was not sudden`) EQUALS `outside the cover of Article 10`

-- Definition 14 and Article 23 come first.
#ASSERT `the cover decision for` (`a claim: vehicle` `a two-wheeled motorcycle` `, policy` `the standard policy` `, claimant` `the insured named on the certificate` `, event` `the standard collision` `, driving` `the standard driving` `, conduct` `prompt and proper conduct` `, shortfall` `no premium shortfall` `, costs` `no costs` `, hire` NOTHING `, wreck` `no wreck kept` `, other insurance` EMPTY) EQUALS `the vehicle is not a car within definition 14`
#ASSERT REFUSED `the cover decision for` (`a standard claim under` `a policy with an Article 23 clause` `for` `the standard collision` `,` `the standard driving`) BECAUSE "the certificate carries an Article 23 clause, whose terms are not in the Rules"

-- Articles 2-3: a loss outside the period.
#ASSERT `the cover decision for` (`a standard claim for` (`a sudden` `a collision` `on` (YMD 2027 1 2) `, damaging` `the standard parts`)) EQUALS `the contract was not in effect` `outside the period of insurance (2.1)`

§ `Tests — Part IV heads: BVVC03 and BVVC04`

#ASSERT `the cover decision for` (`a standard claim under` (`the standard policy with` (LIST `BVVC03 (flood damage)`)) `for` (`a sudden` `flooding in rain, storm or flood` `on 15 June 2026, damaging` `the standard parts`) `,` `the standard driving`) EQUALS `covered under` `BVVC03 water damage to the engine or electrical system`

`a stolen mirror` MEANS `a part replaced:` "wing mirror" `, of kind` `an ordinary part of the vehicle` `, caused by` `theft or robbery of the part` `, for` 6_000_000
`a stolen remote` MEANS `a part replaced:` "remote control" `, of kind` `a key or remote control` `, caused by` `theft or robbery of the part` `, for` 1_500_000

GIVEN `earlier` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH AN `The event`
`a theft of a mirror and a remote, after earlier thefts:` `earlier` MEANS
    `an event on` (YMD 2026 6 15) `: peril` `theft of parts of the vehicle` `, sudden` TRUE `, at` `in Vietnam` `, war` FALSE `, deliberate` EMPTY
        `, hired out` FALSE `, inspection` `a valid inspection certificate` `, load` `a normal load` `, parts` (LIST `a stolen mirror`, `a stolen remote`)
        `, paint` NOTHING `, police suspension` FALSE `, earlier part thefts` `earlier`

-- Without BVVC04 a theft of parts has no head (and 11.14 would exclude it).
#ASSERT `the cover decision for` (`a standard claim for` (`a theft of a mirror and a remote, after earlier thefts:` 0)) EQUALS `outside the cover of Article 10`
#ASSERT `11.14 — theft or robbery of parts` (`a standard claim for` (`a theft of a mirror and a remote, after earlier thefts:` 0))
-- With BVVC04 on a 12-month contract: covered, up to the second theft.
#ASSERT `the cover decision for` (`a standard claim under` (`the standard policy with` (LIST `BVVC04 (theft of parts)`)) `for` (`a theft of a mirror and a remote, after earlier thefts:` 1) `,` `nobody driving`) EQUALS `covered under` `BVVC04 theft or robbery of parts`
#ASSERT `the cover decision for` (`a standard claim under` (`the standard policy with` (LIST `BVVC04 (theft of parts)`)) `for` (`a theft of a mirror and a remote, after earlier thefts:` 2) `,` `nobody driving`) EQUALS `outside the cover of Article 10`
-- An 11-month contract cannot carry BVVC04.
#ASSERT `the cover decision for` (`a standard claim under` (`a policy from 1 January 2026 to` (YMD 2026 11 30) `with` (LIST `BVVC04 (theft of parts)`)) `for` (`a theft of a mirror and a remote, after earlier thefts:` 0) `,` `nobody driving`) EQUALS `outside the cover of Article 10`
-- The remote control is not paid for; the mirror is.
#ASSERT `a stolen mirror` `is paid for in` (`a standard claim under` (`the standard policy with` (LIST `BVVC04 (theft of parts)`)) `for` (`a theft of a mirror and a remote, after earlier thefts:` 0) `,` `nobody driving`)
#ASSERT NOT `a stolen remote` `is paid for in` (`a standard claim under` (`the standard policy with` (LIST `BVVC04 (theft of parts)`)) `for` (`a theft of a mirror and a remote, after earlier thefts:` 0) `,` `nobody driving`)

§ `Tests — Article 11: exclusions about the event`

GIVEN `who` IS A LIST OF `Someone who acted deliberately`
GIVETH AN `The event`
`a collision caused deliberately by` `who` MEANS
    `an event on` (YMD 2026 6 15) `: peril` `a collision` `, sudden` TRUE `, at` `in Vietnam` `, war` FALSE `, deliberate` `who`
        `, hired out` FALSE `, inspection` `a valid inspection certificate` `, load` `a normal load` `, parts` `the standard parts`
        `, paint` NOTHING `, police suspension` FALSE `, earlier part thefts` 0

GIVEN `the person` IS A `The person driving`
GIVETH A `The driving`
`carefully driven by` `the person` MEANS `driven by` `the person` `,` `careful driving`

GIVEN `consent` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `The person driving`
`a sober licensed driver, consent:` `consent` MEANS
    `a person driving: consent` `consent` `, licence` TRUE `, expired` FALSE `, right class` TRUE `, withdrawn` FALSE `, learner` FALSE `, blood` NOTHING `, breath` NOTHING `, drugs` FALSE `, refused a test` FALSE

§§ `11.1`

#ASSERT `the cover decision for` (`a standard claim for` (`a collision caused deliberately by` (LIST `the insured, deliberately`))) EQUALS `excluded by` (LIST `11.1 deliberate damage`)
#ASSERT `the cover decision for` (`a standard claim for` (`a collision caused deliberately by` (LIST `a person with an interest in owning, operating or using the vehicle, deliberately`))) EQUALS `excluded by` (LIST `11.1 deliberate damage`)
#ASSERT `the cover decision for` (`a standard claim for` (`a collision caused deliberately by` (LIST `someone else, deliberately`))) EQUALS `covered under` `10.1.1 collision, overturning, toppling, loss of balance, sinking, falling, or being struck from outside`
#ASSERT `the cover decision for` (`a standard claim under` `the standard policy` `for` (`a collision caused deliberately by` (LIST `the person driving, deliberately`)) `,` (`carefully driven by` (`a sober licensed driver, consent:` TRUE))) EQUALS `excluded by` (LIST `11.1 deliberate damage`)
-- Near miss: the person who crashed deliberately was driving without consent (finding X1).
#ASSERT `the cover decision for` (`a standard claim under` `the standard policy` `for` (`a collision caused deliberately by` (LIST `the person driving, deliberately`)) `,` (`carefully driven by` (`a sober licensed driver, consent:` FALSE))) EQUALS `covered under` `10.1.1 collision, overturning, toppling, loss of balance, sinking, falling, or being struck from outside`

§§ `11.2`

GIVEN `the date`       IS A DATE
      `the inspection` IS A `The inspection status at the time of the loss`
GIVETH AN `The event`
`a collision on` `the date` `, inspection` `the inspection` MEANS
    `an event on` `the date` `: peril` `a collision` `, sudden` TRUE `, at` `in Vietnam` `, war` FALSE `, deliberate` EMPTY
        `, hired out` FALSE `, inspection` `the inspection` `, load` `a normal load` `, parts` `the standard parts`
        `, paint` NOTHING `, police suspension` FALSE `, earlier part thefts` 0

#ASSERT `the cover decision for` (`a standard claim for` (`a collision on` (YMD 2026 6 15) `, inspection` (`inspection: valid` FALSE `, new and awaiting inspection` FALSE `, circulating temporarily` FALSE))) EQUALS `excluded by` (LIST `11.2 no valid inspection certificate`)
-- A new vehicle awaiting inspection: day 30 from 1 January (31 January) is inside the grace, day 31 is not.
#ASSERT `the cover decision for` (`a standard claim for` (`a collision on` (YMD 2026 1 31) `, inspection` (`inspection: valid` FALSE `, new and awaiting inspection` TRUE `, circulating temporarily` FALSE))) EQUALS `covered under` `10.1.1 collision, overturning, toppling, loss of balance, sinking, falling, or being struck from outside`
#ASSERT `the cover decision for` (`a standard claim for` (`a collision on` (YMD 2026 2 1) `, inspection` (`inspection: valid` FALSE `, new and awaiting inspection` TRUE `, circulating temporarily` FALSE))) EQUALS `excluded by` (LIST `11.2 no valid inspection certificate`)

§§ `11.3`

GIVEN `licence`   IS A BOOLEAN
      `expired`   IS A BOOLEAN
      `right`     IS A BOOLEAN
      `withdrawn` IS A BOOLEAN
      `learner`   IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `A claim`
`a collision with consent and licence` `licence` `, expired` `expired` `, right class` `right` `, withdrawn` `withdrawn` `, learner` `learner` MEANS
    `a standard claim under` `the standard policy` `for` `the standard collision` `,`
        (`carefully driven by` (`a person driving: consent` TRUE `, licence` `licence` `, expired` `expired` `, right class` `right` `, withdrawn` `withdrawn` `, learner` `learner` `, blood` NOTHING `, breath` NOTHING `, drugs` FALSE `, refused a test` FALSE))

#ASSERT `11.3 — the driver had no proper licence` (`a collision with consent and licence` FALSE `, expired` FALSE `, right class` FALSE `, withdrawn` FALSE `, learner` FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT `11.3 — the driver had no proper licence` (`a collision with consent and licence` FALSE `, expired` FALSE `, right class` FALSE `, withdrawn` FALSE `, learner` TRUE)
#ASSERT `11.3 — the driver had no proper licence` (`a collision with consent and licence` TRUE `, expired` TRUE `, right class` TRUE `, withdrawn` FALSE `, learner` FALSE)
#ASSERT `11.3 — the driver had no proper licence` (`a collision with consent and licence` TRUE `, expired` FALSE `, right class` FALSE `, withdrawn` FALSE `, learner` FALSE)
#ASSERT `11.3 — the driver had no proper licence` (`a collision with consent and licence` TRUE `, expired` FALSE `, right class` TRUE `, withdrawn` TRUE `, learner` FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT `11.3 — the driver had no proper licence` (`a collision with consent and licence` TRUE `, expired` FALSE `, right class` TRUE `, withdrawn` FALSE `, learner` FALSE)
#ASSERT `the cover decision for` (`a collision with consent and licence` FALSE `, expired` FALSE `, right class` FALSE `, withdrawn` FALSE `, learner` FALSE) EQUALS `excluded by` (LIST `11.3 no proper driving licence`)

§§ `11.4`

GIVEN `blood`  IS A MAYBE NUMBER
      `breath` IS A MAYBE NUMBER
      `drugs`  IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `A claim`
`a collision with the driver's readings` `blood` `,` `breath` `, drugs` `drugs` MEANS
    `a standard claim under` `the standard policy` `for` `the standard collision` `,`
        (`carefully driven by` (`a person driving: consent` TRUE `, licence` TRUE `, expired` FALSE `, right class` TRUE `, withdrawn` FALSE `, learner` FALSE `, blood` `blood` `, breath` `breath` `, drugs` `drugs` `, refused a test` FALSE))

-- "Exceeding 50 mg/100 ml" and "0,25 mg/l" (decimal comma): at the figure is not excluded.
#ASSERT NOT `11.4 — alcohol over the limit, or prohibited drugs` (`a collision with the driver's readings` (JUST 50) `,` NOTHING `, drugs` FALSE)
#ASSERT     `11.4 — alcohol over the limit, or prohibited drugs` (`a collision with the driver's readings` (JUST 51) `,` NOTHING `, drugs` FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT `11.4 — alcohol over the limit, or prohibited drugs` (`a collision with the driver's readings` NOTHING `,` (JUST 0.25) `, drugs` FALSE)
#ASSERT     `11.4 — alcohol over the limit, or prohibited drugs` (`a collision with the driver's readings` NOTHING `,` (JUST 0.26) `, drugs` FALSE)
#ASSERT     `11.4 — alcohol over the limit, or prohibited drugs` (`a collision with the driver's readings` NOTHING `,` NOTHING `, drugs` TRUE)
#ASSERT NOT `11.4 — alcohol over the limit, or prohibited drugs` (`a collision with the driver's readings` NOTHING `,` NOTHING `, drugs` FALSE)
#ASSERT `the cover decision for` (`a collision with the driver's readings` (JUST 80) `,` NOTHING `, drugs` FALSE) EQUALS `excluded by` (LIST `11.4 alcohol or drugs`)

§§ `11.5, 11.6, 11.7`

GIVEN `the manner` IS A `The manner of driving`
GIVETH A `A claim`
`a collision driven by a consenting driver, driving` `the manner` MEANS
    `a standard claim under` `the standard policy` `for` `the standard collision` `,` (`driven by` (`a sober licensed driver, consent:` TRUE) `,` `the manner`)

#ASSERT `the cover decision for` (`a collision driven by a consenting driver, driving` (`driving: wrong way` TRUE `, disobeyed signals` FALSE `, racing` FALSE `, dangerous goods` FALSE `, parked at a no-parking sign` FALSE `, speed excess` NOTHING)) EQUALS `excluded by` (LIST `11.5 wrong way, prohibited turn, traffic signals, or no lights at night`)
#ASSERT `the cover decision for` (`a collision driven by a consenting driver, driving` (`driving: wrong way` FALSE `, disobeyed signals` TRUE `, racing` FALSE `, dangerous goods` FALSE `, parked at a no-parking sign` FALSE `, speed excess` NOTHING)) EQUALS `excluded by` (LIST `11.5 wrong way, prohibited turn, traffic signals, or no lights at night`)
#ASSERT `the cover decision for` (`a collision driven by a consenting driver, driving` (`driving: wrong way` FALSE `, disobeyed signals` FALSE `, racing` TRUE `, dangerous goods` FALSE `, parked at a no-parking sign` FALSE `, speed excess` NOTHING)) EQUALS `excluded by` (LIST `11.6 racing or unlawful towing`)
#ASSERT `the cover decision for` (`a collision driven by a consenting driver, driving` (`driving: wrong way` FALSE `, disobeyed signals` FALSE `, racing` FALSE `, dangerous goods` TRUE `, parked at a no-parking sign` FALSE `, speed excess` NOTHING)) EQUALS `excluded by` (LIST `11.7 dangerous goods without a permit`)
-- Near miss: parking at a no-parking sign is a 15.1.1(d) reduction, not an exclusion.
#ASSERT `the cover decision for` (`a collision driven by a consenting driver, driving` (`driving: wrong way` FALSE `, disobeyed signals` FALSE `, racing` FALSE `, dangerous goods` FALSE `, parked at a no-parking sign` TRUE `, speed excess` NOTHING)) EQUALS `covered under` `10.1.1 collision, overturning, toppling, loss of balance, sinking, falling, or being struck from outside`
-- Near miss: speeding is a 15.1.2(b) reduction, not an exclusion.
#ASSERT `the cover decision for` (`a collision driven by a consenting driver, driving` (`driving: wrong way` FALSE `, disobeyed signals` FALSE `, racing` FALSE `, dangerous goods` FALSE `, parked at a no-parking sign` FALSE `, speed excess` (JUST 0.5))) EQUALS `covered under` `10.1.1 collision, overturning, toppling, loss of balance, sinking, falling, or being struck from outside`

§§ `11.8, 11.9 and BVVC07`

GIVEN `the place` IS A `Where the loss happened`
      `war`       IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH AN `The event`
`a collision at` `the place` `, war` `war` MEANS
    `an event on` (YMD 2026 6 15) `: peril` `a collision` `, sudden` TRUE `, at` `the place` `, war` `war` `, deliberate` EMPTY
        `, hired out` FALSE `, inspection` `a valid inspection certificate` `, load` `a normal load` `, parts` `the standard parts`
        `, paint` NOTHING `, police suspension` FALSE `, earlier part thefts` 0

#ASSERT `the cover decision for` (`a standard claim for` (`a collision at` `elsewhere outside Vietnam` `, war` FALSE)) EQUALS `excluded by` (LIST `11.8 outside Vietnam`)
#ASSERT `the cover decision for` (`a standard claim for` (`a collision at` `in China, Laos, Cambodia or Thailand` `, war` FALSE)) EQUALS `excluded by` (LIST `11.8 outside Vietnam`)
#ASSERT `the cover decision for` (`a standard claim under` (`the standard policy with` (LIST `BVVC07 (damage outside Vietnam)`)) `for` (`a collision at` `in China, Laos, Cambodia or Thailand` `, war` FALSE) `,` `the standard driving`) EQUALS `covered under` `10.1.1 collision, overturning, toppling, loss of balance, sinking, falling, or being struck from outside`
#ASSERT `the cover decision for` (`a standard claim under` (`the standard policy with` (LIST `BVVC07 (damage outside Vietnam)`)) `for` (`a collision at` `elsewhere outside Vietnam` `, war` FALSE) `,` `the standard driving`) EQUALS `excluded by` (LIST `11.8 outside Vietnam`)
#ASSERT `the cover decision for` (`a standard claim for` (`a collision at` `in Vietnam` `, war` TRUE)) EQUALS `excluded by` (LIST `11.9 war or terrorism`)
#ASSERT `the cover decision for` (`a standard claim for` (`a collision at` `elsewhere outside Vietnam` `, war` TRUE)) EQUALS `excluded by` (LIST `11.8 outside Vietnam`, `11.9 war or terrorism`)

§§ `11.15`

GIVEN `hired out` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `A claim`
`a vehicle taken by fraud, hired out:` `hired out` MEANS
    `a standard claim for` `the event`
    WHERE
        `the event` MEANS
            `an event on` (YMD 2026 6 15) `: peril` `the whole vehicle taken by fraud or abuse of trust` `, sudden` TRUE `, at` `in Vietnam` `, war` FALSE `, deliberate` EMPTY
                `, hired out` `hired out` `, inspection` `a valid inspection certificate` `, load` `a normal load` `, parts` EMPTY
                `, paint` NOTHING `, police suspension` FALSE `, earlier part thefts` 0

#ASSERT `11.15 — loss of the whole vehicle by fraud or abuse of trust` (`a vehicle taken by fraud, hired out:` TRUE)
#ASSERT NOT `11.15 — loss of the whole vehicle by fraud or abuse of trust` (`a vehicle taken by fraud, hired out:` FALSE)

§§ `11.16`

GIVEN `the load` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A `A claim`
`a goods vehicle permitted 1000, carrying` `the load` MEANS
    `a claim: vehicle` (`a goods vehicle permitted to carry` 1000) `, policy` `the standard policy` `, claimant` `the insured named on the certificate`
        `, event` `the event` `, driving` `the standard driving` `, conduct` `prompt and proper conduct` `, shortfall` `no premium shortfall` `, costs` `no costs`
        `, hire` NOTHING `, wreck` `no wreck kept` `, other insurance` EMPTY
    WHERE
        `the event` MEANS
            `an event on` (YMD 2026 6 15) `: peril` `a collision` `, sudden` TRUE `, at` `in Vietnam` `, war` FALSE `, deliberate` EMPTY
                `, hired out` FALSE `, inspection` `a valid inspection certificate` `, load` (`carrying` `the load` `, with persons` 2 `, and children under 7` 0) `, parts` `the standard parts`
                `, paint` NOTHING `, police suspension` FALSE `, earlier part thefts` 0

#ASSERT `the cover decision for` (`a goods vehicle permitted 1000, carrying` 1500) EQUALS `excluded by` (LIST `11.16 overloading by 50% or more`)
#ASSERT `the cover decision for` (`a goods vehicle permitted 1000, carrying` 1499) EQUALS `covered under` `10.1.1 collision, overturning, toppling, loss of balance, sinking, falling, or being struck from outside`

§ `Tests — Article 11: exclusions about a damaged part`

`a worn clutch`        MEANS `a part repaired:` "clutch" `, of kind` `an ordinary part of the vehicle` `, caused by` `natural wear and tear` `, for` 4_000_000
`a shorted radio`      MEANS `a part replaced:` "radio" `, of kind` `electrical equipment, air conditioning, an electrical tool, or a part of one` `, caused by` `overload, overpressure, short circuit, self-heating, electric arc or current leakage` `, for` 3_000_000
`a crushed radio`      MEANS `a part replaced:` "radio" `, of kind` `electrical equipment, air conditioning, an electrical tool, or a part of one` `, caused by` `the insured event itself` `, for` 3_000_000
`a drowned engine`     MEANS `a part repaired:` "engine" `, of kind` `the engine` `, caused by` `water, while the vehicle was operating in a flooded area` `, for` 40_000_000
`a parked drowned engine` MEANS `a part repaired:` "engine" `, of kind` `the engine` `, caused by` `water, while the vehicle was not operating` `, for` 40_000_000
`a burst tyre`         MEANS `a part replaced:` "front tyre" `, of kind` `a tyre or inner tube` `, caused by` `the insured event itself` `, for` 2_000_000
`another burst tyre`   MEANS `a part replaced:` "rear tyre" `, of kind` `a tyre or inner tube` `, caused by` `the insured event itself` `, for` 2_000_000
`a roof box`           MEANS `a part replaced:` "roof box" `, of kind` `other added equipment` `, caused by` `the insured event itself` `, for` 5_000_000
`an aftermarket alarm` MEANS `a part replaced:` "alarm" `, of kind` `added equipment that protects the vehicle (an alarm, a front or rear bumper)` `, caused by` `the insured event itself` `, for` 5_000_000
`a permitted tow bar`  MEANS `a part replaced:` "tow bar" `, of kind` `added equipment fitted as the regulations provide` `, caused by` `the insured event itself` `, for` 5_000_000
`a door burnt by an added light bar` MEANS `a part repaired:` "door" `, of kind` `an ordinary part of the vehicle` `, caused by` `other added equipment` `, for` 6_000_000

GIVEN `the peril` IS A `A peril`
      `the parts` IS A LIST OF `A damaged part`
      `the clauses` IS A LIST OF `A supplementary clause`
GIVETH A `A claim`
`a claim for a sudden` `the peril` `damaging` `the parts` `under clauses` `the clauses` MEANS
    `a standard claim under` (`the standard policy with` `the clauses`) `for` (`a sudden` `the peril` `on 15 June 2026, damaging` `the parts`) `,` `the standard driving`

#ASSERT `the exclusions that bite on` `a worn clutch` `in` (`a claim for a sudden` `a collision` `damaging` (LIST `a worn clutch`, `a door repaired for 8 million`) `under clauses` EMPTY) EQUALS LIST `11.10 wear and tear, inherent nature, loss of value, defect, or repair`
#ASSERT `the exclusions that bite on` `a door repaired for 8 million` `in` (`a claim for a sudden` `a collision` `damaging` (LIST `a worn clutch`, `a door repaired for 8 million`) `under clauses` EMPTY) EQUALS EMPTY
#ASSERT `the exclusions that bite on` `a shorted radio` `in` (`a claim for a sudden` `a fire` `damaging` (LIST `a shorted radio`) `under clauses` EMPTY) EQUALS LIST `11.11 electrical damage to electrical equipment`
#ASSERT `the exclusions that bite on` `a crushed radio` `in` (`a claim for a sudden` `a collision` `damaging` (LIST `a crushed radio`) `under clauses` EMPTY) EQUALS EMPTY
#ASSERT `the exclusions that bite on` `a drowned engine` `in` (`a claim for a sudden` `a natural catastrophe beyond human control` `damaging` (LIST `a drowned engine`) `under clauses` EMPTY) EQUALS LIST `11.12 water damage to the engine or electrical system while operating in a flooded area`
#ASSERT `the exclusions that bite on` `a drowned engine` `in` (`a claim for a sudden` `a natural catastrophe beyond human control` `damaging` (LIST `a drowned engine`) `under clauses` (LIST `BVVC03 (flood damage)`)) EQUALS EMPTY
#ASSERT `the exclusions that bite on` `a parked drowned engine` `in` (`a claim for a sudden` `a natural catastrophe beyond human control` `damaging` (LIST `a parked drowned engine`) `under clauses` EMPTY) EQUALS EMPTY
-- 11.13: a tyre alone is excluded; with a door damaged by the same event it is not; two tyres
-- together do not save each other (fork F23).
#ASSERT `the exclusions that bite on` `a burst tyre` `in` (`a claim for a sudden` `a collision` `damaging` (LIST `a burst tyre`) `under clauses` EMPTY) EQUALS LIST `11.13 tyres, tarpaulins or labels damaged alone`
#ASSERT `the exclusions that bite on` `a burst tyre` `in` (`a claim for a sudden` `a collision` `damaging` (LIST `a burst tyre`, `a door repaired for 8 million`) `under clauses` EMPTY) EQUALS EMPTY
#ASSERT `the exclusions that bite on` `a burst tyre` `in` (`a claim for a sudden` `a collision` `damaging` (LIST `a burst tyre`, `another burst tyre`) `under clauses` EMPTY) EQUALS LIST `11.13 tyres, tarpaulins or labels damaged alone`
#ASSERT `the exclusions that bite on` `a roof box` `in` (`a claim for a sudden` `a collision` `damaging` (LIST `a roof box`) `under clauses` EMPTY) EQUALS LIST `11.17 added equipment`
